       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. BILL100.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  ACCT-BAL        PIC S9(7)V99 VALUE +100.00.
       01  REJECT-FLAG     PIC X VALUE 'N'.
       01  INTEREST-VAL    PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE 000.00.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           PERFORM VALIDATE-INPUT
           PERFORM CALC-INTEREST
           STOP RUN.

       VALIDATE-INPUT.
           IF ACCT-BAL < 0
               PERFORM RAISE-ERROR
           END-IF.

       CALC-INTEREST.
           COMPUTE INTEREST-VAL = ACCT-BAL * 0.05.

       RAISE-ERROR.
           MOVE 'Y' TO REJECT-FLAG.
